--- !u!114 &1032504065
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1032504062}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 874faff9495a840e69fda1f250e7cfcb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: CodeAssembly::DailogueTrigger
  Slides:
  - Character: {fileID: 0}
    Lines:
    - Line: 'The king of the Island of Gadies stubbornly lies on his deathbed. '
      alternitiveTextBox: {fileID: 1988456125}
      CharacterOverride: {fileID: 0}
      CharacterBody: 0
      CharacterFace: 0
      LineStartEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
      LineEndEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
    - Line: While holding onto grave feelings of anger and regret, he still holds
        onto great pride and self importance.
      alternitiveTextBox: {fileID: 230760485}
      CharacterOverride: {fileID: 0}
      CharacterBody: 0
      CharacterFace: 0
      LineStartEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
      LineEndEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
    - Line: Despite his condition, he insists on bearing the crown upon his head,
        and barks at anyone who attempts to suggest the succession of power.
      alternitiveTextBox: {fileID: 866587505}
      CharacterOverride: {fileID: 0}
      CharacterBody: 0
      CharacterFace: 0
      LineStartEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
      LineEndEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
    - Line: Arms frail, speech slurred and slow, and eyes glued to the ceiling above
        him, while holding a tireless glare.
      alternitiveTextBox: {fileID: 1909663270}
      CharacterOverride: {fileID: 0}
      CharacterBody: 0
      CharacterFace: 0
      LineStartEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
      LineEndEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
    - Line: His movement remains restricted, his head hangs heavy by the weight of
        the crown but he will not remove it.
      alternitiveTextBox: {fileID: 501281931}
      CharacterOverride: {fileID: 0}
      CharacterBody: 0
      CharacterFace: 0
      LineStartEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
      LineEndEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
    - Line: He stubbornly insists on holding onto his crown and title.
      alternitiveTextBox: {fileID: 501281931}
      CharacterOverride: {fileID: 0}
      CharacterBody: 0
      CharacterFace: 0
      LineStartEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
      LineEndEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
    - Line: He is well aware he will soon pass, and that by the tradition of the
        castle, his eldest son will be set to take the throne, but he simply will
        not grant the succession.
      alternitiveTextBox: {fileID: 666984863}
      CharacterOverride: {fileID: 0}
      CharacterBody: 0
      CharacterFace: 0
      LineStartEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
      LineEndEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
    alternitiveCanvasGroup: {fileID: 0}
  - Character: {fileID: 0}
    Lines:
    - Line: After much conflict, the king orders the creation of a second crown of
        a new model for his son for he will how part with his own.
      alternitiveTextBox: {fileID: 982860741}
      CharacterOverride: {fileID: 0}
      CharacterBody: 0
      CharacterFace: 0
      LineStartEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
      LineEndEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
    - Line: He orders that he is buried and forever guarded while still bearing the
        original.
      alternitiveTextBox: {fileID: 995842683}
      CharacterOverride: {fileID: 0}
      CharacterBody: 0
      CharacterFace: 0
      LineStartEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
      LineEndEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
    - Line: 'Heavy as his head seems, he makes known that the moment his crown is
        removed is the moment the weight will be too much for him to bear. '
      alternitiveTextBox: {fileID: 761924040}
      CharacterOverride: {fileID: 0}
      CharacterBody: 0
      CharacterFace: 0
      LineStartEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
      LineEndEvent:
        _PersistentCalls: []
    alternitiveCanvasGroup: {fileID: 0}
  EndOfLines: []
  DefultEvent:
    _PersistentCalls:
    - _Target: {fileID: 830621551}
      _MemberName: PlayTimeline
      _PersistentArguments: []
